$NetBSD$

Retain an owned filename through verbose override logging, then release it.
Allocate the test IO writer before changing shared buffer state; on allocation
failure, return NULL without leaking a new buffer or freeing caller state.

Local EmberBSD adaptation for LLVM 23.1.4, developed with AI assistance.
Not submitted upstream. LLVM main and FreeBSD main retained both paths when
checked on 2026-10-27. Preserve upstream Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception terms.
https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/blob/llvmorg-23.1.4/compiler-rt/lib/profile/InstrProfilingFile.c

